About the Dataset

This dataset contains information about individuals' sleep patterns and habits. It may include details such as sleep duration, quality, bedtime, wake-up time, lifestyle factors, and other relevant health indicators.

The purpose of this dataset is to analyze sleep behavior and understand how different factors affect sleep quality and overall health. By studying this data, we can identify patterns, compare results, and draw insights that may help improve healthy sleep habits.

This dataset can be useful in health research, lifestyle analysis, and data visualization projects. It helps in understanding the relationship between sleep and daily performance.


---------
This dataset may seem small, but I found it suitable because it contained no duplicates and few missing values.
